3.  **Hub-and-spoke model**: The airport operates under a hub-and-spoke model, where flights from smaller cities (spokes) converge at the hub airport, and then connect to other destinations (spokes) or other hubs.
4.  **Aircraft maintenance and repair facilities**: Major airline hubs often have on-site maintenance and repair facilities to support the operations of the airlines operating at the airport.
