* In 2005, the Midland Group bought the team from Eddie Jordan and renamed it Midland F1 Racing.
* In 2006, the team was sold to Spyker Cars N.V. and competed as Spyker MF1 Racing in its last three Grands Prix of the season.
* In 2007, the team competed as Spyker F1.
